  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Le Coin Canin is a grooming salon located on avenue Pierre Auguste Renoir in La Seyne-sur-Mer, west of the Toulon roadstead, right next to the Bricomarché, with parking (including underground) and wheelchair access. A long-time customer says: "for my 3rd appointment, still just as satisfied, excellent welcome, very clean salon, careful work."</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Closed Monday and Sunday; open Tuesday from 8:30 to 11:45am then 2 to 4pm, Wednesday to Friday from 8:30 to 11:45am then 2 to 5:30pm, and Saturday from 9am to 12pm. Besides grooming and nail trimming, the salon sells Husse-brand kibble and products, shampoos, accessories, collars, leashes and coats.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call directly to book your slot, especially in high season when salons in the area fill up fast.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>La Seyne-sur-Mer and its seafront are close by.</p>
